sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as React SPA (In-Memory)
    participant Server as Node.js API
    participant Cookie as Cookie Jar (HttpOnly)

    Note over Browser, Cookie: Authentication
    Browser->>Server: POST /login { email, password }
    Server->>Server: Validate Credentials
    Server->>Cookie: Set-Cookie: refreshToken (domain=.example.com, HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax)
    Server-->>Browser: { accessToken }
    Browser->>Browser: Store accessToken in variable

    Note over Browser, Cookie: Standard API Request
    Browser->>Server: GET /ledgers (Authorization: Bearer accessToken)
    Server-->>Browser: 200 OK [Data]

    Note over Browser, Cookie: Token Expiry & Silent Refresh
    Browser->>Server: GET /ledgers (Expired Token)
    Server-->>Browser: 401 Unauthorized
    Browser->>Server: POST /refresh (Browser automatically includes Cookie)
    Server->>Cookie: Validate refreshToken
    Server->>Cookie: Set-Cookie: newRefreshToken (Rotation)
    Server-->>Browser: { accessToken: "new..." }
    Browser->>Browser: Update memory & retry original request